sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator as Operator / Admin
    participant Antarmuka as Antarmuka Web
    participant Server as Server (FastAPI)
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Server,DB: HKN-008 — Simpan Backup ke Database

    alt Pengambilan konfigurasi berhasil
        Server->>+DB: Simpan Backup (hash, timestamp, config_text, status)
        DB-->>-Server: Backup tersimpan
    else Pengambilan konfigurasi gagal
        Server->>+DB: Simpan Backup dengan status failed; catat BackupFailure
        DB-->>-Server: Tersimpan
    end

    Note over Server,DB: HKN-009, HKN-010, HKN-015 — Notifikasi

    opt Konfigurasi berubah (hash berbeda dari sebelumnya)
        Server->>Server: Kirim notifikasi perubahan konfigurasi via Apprise
    end

    opt Backup gagal
        Server->>Server: Kirim notifikasi kegagalan diagnostik
    end

    Server->>+DB: Perbarui JobRun (devices_success, devices_failed, status)
    DB-->>-Server: JobRun diperbarui
    Server->>Server: Kirim notifikasi job (on_success atau on_failure)

    alt Pemicu jadwal
        Note over Server: Eksekusi background selesai
    else Permintaan manual
        Server-->>Antarmuka: Redirect ke halaman backup
        Antarmuka-->>Operator: Tampilkan status hasil backup
        deactivate Server
        deactivate Antarmuka
    end
